OL,3,GNEWSAMan Utd and Arsenal wins among
OL,4,A'best in Brighton's history'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBrighton & Hove Albion owner Tony Bloom
OL,7,Fsays he is looking forward to seeing
OL,8,Fwhat the Seagulls can achieve after
OL,9,Fresults he described as the "best in
OL,10,Fthe history of the football club".
OL,12,FIn a rare interview, Bloom told BBC
OL,13,FSouth East victory over Manchester
OL,14,FUnited in the Carabao Cup, a 3-0 win
OL,15,Fover champions Arsenal, and the 5-0
OL,16,Fthrashing of Coventry City had boosted
OL,17,Fconfidence at the club.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
