OL,3,GNEWSAMan Utd and Arsenal wins among
OL,4,A'best in Brighton's history'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBloom helped transform Brighton's
OL,7,Ffortunes after he became majority
OL,8,Fshareholder at the club in 2009, when
OL,9,Fthe team were struggling in the third
OL,10,Ftier of English football and playing at
OL,11,Fa temporary ground.
OL,13,F"(I'm) looking forward to what this
OL,14,Fteam can achieve this season", Bloom
OL,15,Fsaid.
